      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">יֵהוּא</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino. (</strong>provavelmente contraído de <span dir=\"rtl\">יהוהוא</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>é Ele</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, יֵשׁוּעַ\" href=\"/BDB,_יֵשׁוּעַ\", dir=\"rtl\">יֵשׁוּעַ</a> e referências; cuneiforme <em>Ia-u-a</em> COT <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:23\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.23\">1 K 16:23</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.2\">2 K 9:2</a> (ainda Schr<sup>MBAW 1880, 277,</sup> Schr<sup>ZA iii. 3</sup> Hpt<sup>BAS i. 296, 329</sup> Jäger <sup>ib. 468</sup>); cf. também <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֱלִיהוּ\" href=\"/BDB,_אֱלִיהוּ\", dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִיהוּ</a><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  rei de Israel que derrubou a dinastia de Onri (𝔊 Εἰου, A frequentemente Ἰηου, 𝔊L Ἰου) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:16\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.16\">1 K 19:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:17\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.17\">17</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.2\">2 K 9:2</a> + 36 vezes <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9\" href=\"/II_Kings.9\">2 K 9</a> e 10 + <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.2\">12:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.1\">13:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.8\">14:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.12\">15:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 22:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.22.7\">2 Ch 22:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 22:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.22.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 22:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.22.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.17\">25:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 1:4\" href=\"/Hosea.1.4\">Ho 1:4</a>.<br>†<strong>2.</strong>  profeta do norte de Israel no tempo de Baasa e Josafá (𝔊 Εἰου, A Εἰηου 𝔊L Ἰου em Rs; 𝔊 Ἰου, Ἰησου, A 𝔊L Ἰηου em Cr) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.1\">1 K 16:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.12\">12</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 19:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.19.2\">2 Ch 19:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:34\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.34\">20:34</a>.<br>†<strong>3.</strong>  um dos heróis de Davi <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.3\">1 Ch 12:3</a> <strong>(</strong>𝔊 Ἰηουλ, 𝔊L Ἰηουδ)<strong>).</strong><br>†<strong>4.</strong>  um judaíta <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.38\">1 Ch 2:38</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (𝔊 Ἰησους, A 𝔊L Ἰηου).<br><strong>5.</strong>  um príncipe simeonita <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:35\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.35\">1 Ch 4:35</a> (𝔊 οὗτος isto é, <span dir=\"rtl\">(י)הוּא</span>; A 𝔊L Ἰηου).",
