      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹאָחָז</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹאָחָז</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino. (</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>agarrou;</em> 𝔊 Ἰωαχας, e Ἰωαχαζ; cf. também <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֲחַזְיָ֫הוּ\" href=\"/BDB,_אֲחַזְיָ֫הוּ\", dir=\"rtl\">אֲחַזְיָהוּ</a>, e cuneiforme <em>Ia-u-ḫa-zi</em> para Acaz, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אָחָז\" href=\"/BDB,_אָחָז\", dir=\"rtl\">אָחָז</a>, e cf. ainda Jäger<sup>BAS i. 467 f.</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹאָחָז</span> rei de Judá, filho de Josias <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:30\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.30\">2 K 23:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:31\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.31\">31</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:34\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.34\">34</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.1\">2 Ch 36:1</a>, = <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹאָחָז</span> v. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.4\">2:4</a> (aparentemente = <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹחָנָן</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.15\">1 Ch 3:15</a>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹאָחָז</span> rei de Israel, filho de Jeú <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:35\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.35\">2 K 10:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.1\">13:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:4\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:7\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:22\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.25\">25</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.8\">14:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:17\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.17\">17</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.17\">2 Ch 25:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.25\">25</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹאָחָז</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.1\">2 K 14:1</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹאָחָז</span> rei de Judá, filho de Jeorão de Judá <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 21:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.21.17\">2 Ch 21:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:23\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.23\">25:23</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחַזְיָהוּ (אֲחַזְיָה)</span> <strong>2,</strong> v. este.<br><strong>4.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹאָחָז</span> pai de <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹאָח</span> cronista de Josias <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.8\">2 Ch 34:8</a>.",
