      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹאָשׁ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹאָשׁ</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino.</strong> 𝔊 Ἰωας <strong>(</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>é forte</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אישׁ\" href=\"/BDB,_אישׁ\", dir=\"rtl\">אישׁ</a>; ou <em>concedeu</em>, cf. árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">آسَ</span> conceder; fenício <span dir=\"rtl\">יאש</span> nome próprio feminino; sabeu <span dir=\"rtl\">אלאוס</span> Hal 150, <span dir=\"rtl\">אוסאל</span> Hal 144, <span dir=\"rtl\">יאוסאל</span> Hal 192, cf. DHM<sup>ZMG 1883, 15</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהו׳</span> rei de Judá, filho de Acazias (Jeoacaz <strong>3</strong>) <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.1\">2 K 12:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:3\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:5\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:7\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:19\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.19\">19</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.13\">14:13</a>, = <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹאָשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.2\">2 K 11:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:20\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.20\">12:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:21\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.21\">21</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.1\">13:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.10\">10</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.1\">14:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:3\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:17\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.11\">1 Ch 3:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 22:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.22.11\">2 Ch 22:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.2\">24:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:24\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.24\">24</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:23\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.23\">25:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.25\">25</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹאָשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.1\">2 Ch 24:1</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> rei de Israel, filho de Jeoacaz <strong>2</strong>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.10\">2 K 13:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.25\">25</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.8\">14:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:11\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:17\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.17\">17</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹאָשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.9\">2 K 13:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.13\">13</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.25\">25</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.1\">14:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:27\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.27\">27</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.17\">2 Ch 25:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:21\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:23\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.25\">25</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 1:1\" href=\"/Hosea.1.1\">Ho 1:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:1\" href=\"/Amos.1.1\">Am 1:1</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יו׳</span> pai de Gideão (Jerubaal) <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:11\" href=\"/Judges.6.11\">Ju 6:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:29\" href=\"/Judges.6.29\">29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:30\" href=\"/Judges.6.30\">30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:31\" href=\"/Judges.6.31\">31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:14\" href=\"/Judges.7.14\">7:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:13\" href=\"/Judges.8.13\">8:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:29\" href=\"/Judges.8.29\">29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:32\" href=\"/Judges.8.32\">32</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:32\" href=\"/Judges.8.32\">32</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יו׳</span> um príncipe da casa de Acabe, chamado <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּן־הַמֶּלֶךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:26\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.26\">1 K 22:26</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 18:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.18.25\">2 Ch 18:25</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יו׳</span> um dos heróis de Davi <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.3\">1 Ch 12:3</a> (𝔊 Ἰωα, Ἰωας, A Ἰωρας).<br><strong>6.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹאָשׁ</span> um príncipe judaíta <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.22\">1 Ch 4:22</a> (𝔊 Ἰωαδα, Ἰωας).",
